    "summary": "The wave 4 exit condition and the product's own proof. A three-node StatefulSet on Kubernetes with object storage for backups and archived ledger segments, one origin behind an ingress, metrics scraped, backups on a schedule, and an end-to-end harness that drives the whole product through a real client path: sign in, connect, capture, import, curate, recall, promote, export, and erase. When this is green the specification has been demonstrated rather than argued.\n",
